<mark name="m81243--fs-id2466117"/><p>digit saka kiwa menyang tengen: lima, pitu, sanga; tandha koma; enem, nol, siji

Bagean a: sanga

Bagean be: enem

Bagean ce: nol

Bagean de: pitu

Bagean e: lima

Wangsulan.

Bagean a: éwuan

Bagean be: atusan

Bagean ce: puluhan

Bagean de: puluhan éwu

Bagean e: atusan éwu</p><break time="600ms"/>
